<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables -.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables -.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Monday that Office Depot Inc, National Media Corp and PAR Technology Corp were not available for after-hours trading for news.</p>
<p>The exchange said Buenos Aires Embotelladora SA and Corimon SACA were also unavailable.</p>
